sequenceDiagram
  participant surface
  participant broker
  participant client
  surface->>broker: hello (p256 key)
  client->>broker: hello (p256 key)
  broker-->>client: welcome + peer hello
  client->>broker: subscribe (scopes)
  broker-->>client: subscribed
  surface->>broker: publish (sealed p)
  broker-->>client: publish (still sealed)
  client->>broker: call (sealed p)
  broker-->>surface: call (still sealed)
